{
  "name": "DocHub demo: send unsent sign requests",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Send sign requests from the sheet\n\nClick **Execute workflow**. Every row with an email and an empty **sent** cell gets one sign request from the template. **sent** is then set to that copy's URL, so the next click skips it.\n\nBefore the first run on n8n Cloud:\n1. Install the **DocHub** community node (`n8n-nodes-dochub`) in this workspace.\n2. On both Google Sheets nodes, choose a Google account that can edit [the spreadsheet](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID/edit).\n3. On **Send sign request**, choose the **DocHub API** credential. The key must be allowed to edit the template and create sign requests.\n4. Set **Role Name** to the role that already owns the fields on the template. Leave **Fields** empty. A role name the template does not have is created on the template.\n\n**status** is filled by the webhook workflow when DocHub reports a terminal status. A failed send leaves **sent** empty, so the next click retries that row.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-40, -440],
      "id": "c4a1e7b0-6d24-4f1a-9c31-0e5b8a7d1001",
      "name": "How to run this demo"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "id": "c4a1e7b0-6d24-4f1a-9c31-0e5b8a7d1002",
      "name": "When clicking 'Execute workflow'"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "resource": "sheet",
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID/edit",
          "mode": "url"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "0",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [280, 0],
      "id": "c4a1e7b0-6d24-4f1a-9c31-0e5b8a7d1003",
      "name": "Read signers"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "email-present",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json.email ?? '').toString().trim() }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "not-sent",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json.sent ?? '').toString().trim() }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "empty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [560, 0],
      "id": "c4a1e7b0-6d24-4f1a-9c31-0e5b8a7d1004",
      "name": "Not sent yet"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "signRequest",
        "operation": "sendFromTemplate",
        "templateId": "https://dochub.com/your-name/mqNjP3BVW0doMPGw9yGzLk/contract",
        "signers": {
          "signer": [
            {
              "roleName": "Signer",
              "email": "={{ $json.email }}",
              "name": "={{ $json.name }}",
              "fields": []
            }
          ]
        },
        "subject": "Please sign this document",
        "message": "=Hi {{ $json.name }},\n\nPlease review and sign this document."
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-dochub.docHub",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [840, 0],
      "id": "c4a1e7b0-6d24-4f1a-9c31-0e5b8a7d1005",
      "name": "Send sign request",
      "notes": "Role Name must already exist on the template. Fields is empty on purpose, so the template keeps its current field assignments.",
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "no-error",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.error }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "empty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1120, 0],
      "id": "c4a1e7b0-6d24-4f1a-9c31-0e5b8a7d1006",
      "name": "Send succeeded"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "resource": "sheet",
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID/edit",
          "mode": "url"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "0",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "row_number": "={{ $('Read signers').item.json.row_number }}",
            "sent": "={{ $json.document?.fullUrl || $json.documentId || $now.toISO() }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": ["row_number"],
